<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Corpgro cautions shareholders on talks.</title>
<headline>Corpgro cautions shareholders on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corpgro Ltd said on Monday talks were taking place which could affect the group's share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
